# Third-party process-lifetime allocations made while Spring initializes its
# OpenGL driver. These frames are all in the proprietary NVIDIA driver, outside
# SBC and Spring's ownership. Keep this intentionally narrow: an allocation
# whose stack reaches editor or engine code still fails LeakSanitizer.
leak:libnvidia-glcore.so

# NVIDIA registers with the session bus during driver initialization. The
# resulting libdbus allocations are owned by that same process-lifetime driver
# setup and do not have a teardown API available to the engine.
leak:dbus_bus_register
